      "content": "i hear u on the turnout thing, but that's not really what i meant. i'm talking about the actual security. people are posting videos and claims about ballot harvesting and chains of custody being broken. if those things are happening, isn't the \"reliable\" label kind of a lie? why are people so quick to just dismiss those concerns as if they aren't real risks?",
